– Läsning av åtkomstloggar (GetAccessLogForPatient)</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-SEEHDSAuditEventPatientQuery.html">SE EHDS AuditEvent – Sökning och träfflista med patient (BALP PatientQuery)</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-SEEHDSAuditEventPatientRead.html">SE EHDS AuditEvent – Innehållshämtning med patient (BALP PatientRead)</a></td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="Patient1-1" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>Patient</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">FHIR-kärnresurs</span><br/><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/patient.html">Patient</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul/></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-6"><span class="lead">Profiler som stöds</span><p><a href="StructureDefinition-SEEHDSPatient.html">SE EHDS Patient</a></p></div></div><p/></div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="Condition1-2" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resurskonformans: unspecified </span>Condition</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">FHIR-kärnresurs</span><br/><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/condition.html">Condition</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Referenspolicy</span><br/></div><div class="col-lg-4"><span class="lead">Interaktionssammanfattning</span><br/><ul/></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-6"><span class="lead">Profiler som stöds</span><p><a href="StructureDefinition-SEEHDSConditionDiagnosis.html">SE EHDS Condition – Diagnos (GetDiagnosis)</a><br/><a